          "type": "mc",
          "stem": "Select the correct equation for the following problem:\nLilit has 324 stamps in her stamp collection. This is 4 times as many stamps as Bligh has in her collection. How many stamps does Bligh have? (Let Bligh have N stamps)",
          "options": [
            "\\( 4N = 324 \\)",
            "\\( 324 - N = 4 \\)",
            "\\( N = 4 \\times 324 \\)",
            "\\( N + 4 = 324 \\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "Lilit's total is equal to 4 times Bligh's total.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Bligh has \\(N\\) stamps."
            },
            {
              "explain": "4 times as many is \\(4N\\)."
            },
            {
              "explain": "Lilit has 324 stamps, so \\( 4N = 324 \\)."
            }
          ],
